 panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>		Negotiate terms and finalize formal design agreement(s)</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>STEP FIVE:	</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>	Develop the design</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>STEP SIX:	</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>	Process documents through the Authority Having Jurisdiction [City, County, State, Federal]</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>STEP SEVEN:</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="bg1"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Franklin Gothic Book" panose="020B0503020102020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/></a:rPr><a:t>	Negotiate terms and finalize for construction agreement(s)</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2000" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr v